<title>UK: Anglian Water sets 150 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Anglian Water sets 150 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ANGLIAN WATER PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    29.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+52 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p> NOTES	STANDARD WATER UTILITY EVENT PUT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
